      "value": "I must admit some way to modify it would be nice, indeed. Maybe something like that steam or oculus home where you have an inventory of stuff to spawn. Or they could just add it to the SDK ;-) ? Only the geometry and materials without all the infos or toys would me more than enough. That would give new people a playground for first babysteps like placing a mirror, add a trigger or how chairs or video panels work, without the hassle of creating the room first. Maybe it would even lure them into the sdk just to have the most beautiful home.",
